## Highlights
PLGA/chitosan nanofibers were synthesized via electrospinning process Paclitaxel was loaded into PLGA/chitosan nanofibers against prostate cancer NaY, ZSM-5 zeolites and ZIF-8, MIL-101 NMOFs were loaded into fibers The sustained release of Paclitaxel from fibers was obtained during 30 days The inhibition of tumor growth was optimized by PLGA/chitosan/ZIF-8/Paclitaxel
